    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_38ff80cb8973\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Predict the acute toxicity to fish LC50 of a chemical from its molecular descriptors using regression.\n- Target: `LC50` (regression)\n- Primary metric: `mae` (minimize)\n\n## Summary\nThe objective was to predict the acute toxicity to fish LC of a chemical from its molecular descriptors using regression. The platform tested multiple algorithms including a baseline linear model and gradient boosting. It successfully delivered a verified HistGradientBoostingRegressor model achieving a validation mae of 0.6683 and a test mae of 0.7227.\n\n**Observations**\n- The gradient boosting candidate outperformed the baseline linear model during cross-validation.\n- Leakage screen flagged potential feature leakage requiring methodological review.\n- The final model achieved a test r score of 0.5406.\n\n**Limitations**\n- Potential feature leakage was flagged and requires review.\n- Only a small subset of features was evaluated in this run.\n- The results do not show performance on external or out-of-distribution chemical datasets.\n\n_Written by the Reporter; every number above is filled in from stored metrics._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_2081d18d`: HistGradientBoostingRegressor with default hyperparameters to improve prediction accuracy over Ridge.\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| mae | 0.7227 | 0.6683 |\n| rmse | 1.0086 | 0.9519 |\n| r2 | 0.5406 | 0.5868 |\n\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| allowed_features | passed | trial code received exactly the contract's allowed features |\n| split_respected | passed | random split: disjoint, complete |\n| test_labels_not_accessed | passed | every predict stage saw features and the model only |\n| output_shape | passed | one prediction per planned row, task-shaped columns |\n| finite_outputs | passed | all predictions finite and well-formed |\n| metric_recomputation | passed | recomputed metrics match the harness |\n| artifact_loads | passed | the frozen model loaded in a sandbox and predicted the test split |\n| resource_limits | passed | every stage completed inside the submitted job's limits |\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict arrives with verifier v2 (S3.C4) |\n\n## Trials\n| Trial | Kind | Status | Validation mae (mean \u00b1 std, folds) | Hypothesis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `trl_2081d18d` | candidate | verified | 0.6683 \u00b1 0.0239 (3) | HistGradientBoostingRegressor with default hyperparameters to improve prediction accuracy over Ridge. |\n| `trl_65f7cd8e` | baseline | validated | 0.7267 \u00b1 0.0098 (3) | Baseline linear model with StandardScaler and Ridge regression on all 6 numeric features |\n| `trl_72142c76` | candidate | validated | 0.6889 \u00b1 0.0370 (3) | RandomForestRegressor model with standard configuration. |\n\n## Data\n- Split: random, 20% test, kfold_3\n- Features used: 6; excluded: none\n- Leakage screen: Leakage candidates flagged: 1 among 6 screened features; methodological review is required.\n\n## Decision and faults\n- Decision: train (approved_plan)\n\n## Run notes\n- Stage-1 placeholder (D-019): contract built by code, plan approved by policy; replaced by the Data Lead (S3.A2) and the plan gate (S3.D2).\n- The agent finished after 15 model turns, 13 tool calls; it nominated trl_2081d18d.\n- Final candidate trl_2081d18d: nominated by the agent.\n- Final job job_1794149458099473965_ded8b2: test split scored once; verifier v1 passed.\n\n## Sources\n- `task_spec:run_38ff80cb8973.v1`\n- `profile:run_38ff80cb8973.profile.75ba1549dbac`\n- `experiment_contract:run_38ff80cb8973.v1`\n- `result:trl_2081d18d/test`\n"
